</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou Sunshine of my heart!</l><l>Fill Thou each crevice there,</l><l>And let Thy garden yield to Thee</l><l>A fragrance sweet and rare.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thou Ransomer from death!</l><l>Possess Thy ransomed one:</l><l>Appropriate to Thine Own use</l><l>The spoil that Thou hast won.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Thou Lord of Life and Light!</l><l>I bow beneath Thy sway,</l><l>And count it holy privilege</l><l>Thy precepts to obey.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Thou Gift unspeakable!</l><l>Straight from God’s heart of love;</l><l>I break my heart to give Thee room</l><l>And thus Thy sweetness prove.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
